{
  "message": "I’m sorry about the delay and the impact on your meeting. I can help confirm the delay and go over what we can do. To set expectations: under our policy, compensation for delayed flights is available only if you choose to change or cancel the reservation due to the delay. In that case, we can issue a travel certificate (voucher) of $50 per passenger after we process the change/cancellation. We’re not able to credit compensation back to the original payment method for delays, and we can’t issue compensation if you keep the itinerary unchanged. If you’d still like to keep your flight as is, I can transfer you to a human agent to file a formal complaint. To proceed, please provide: 1) your user ID, 2) the flight date for HAT045 (PHX → SEA), and 3) how many passengers are on your reservation. Once I have the date, I’ll verify the delay. Then, please let me know whether you want to: A) change or cancel to receive a certificate ($50 per passenger), or B) keep the flight unchanged and be transferred to a human agent to file your complaint."
}

